              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تسامح (tasāmuḥ) is built on the native Arabic root s-m-ḥ, \"to be generous, to grant\" (Lane). Tasāmuḥ is the Form VI verbal noun, being generous with one another: tolerance. سامح, to forgive, is from the same root."
